# Those Old Scientists runs all three chapters: chapter I draws two Islands and discards the Lightning Bolt and one Island,
# chapter II on turn 3 returns the Bolt from the graveyard to hand, and chapter III on turn 5 shuffles two cards from different
# graveyards (Bot1's sacrificed Black Lotus and the Island Bot2 discarded to hand size) into their owners' libraries. In chapter II
# an Island card is refused: only an artifact, instant or sorcery card of your graveyard (CR 115.1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Those Old Scientists
Lightning Bolt
Island x4
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Those Old Scientists.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Island)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Black Lotus; Bot2.Graveyard.Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Those Old Scientists; Island
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 1
Bot1.Library.Count = 9
Bot1.Hand.Count = 8
